  // The club a 2025 card shows has to be the club that player was on in 2025.
  // Clubs reach the base from the 2026 rosters only and are then copied onto
  // every other card of the same person, so a Major 1 2025 trio card was wearing
  // next year's badge: measured against the real Lyon field, 48 of the 83
  // players it could be checked against were wrong — SwizzY at Team HavoK when
  // he won the season with Gentle Mates, Malibuca at BIG when he played for
  // Gentle Mates, MrSavage at XSET when he was Red Bull.
  //
  // This is the Global Championship field as Liquipedia records it, which is
  // September 2025 — the right club for Major 3 and the LAN, and for Major 1 in
  // February the right season rather than the right week. Written by
